        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2145, Round Privacy Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Privacy Round Tubular Pocket Door Set comes packaged with a 2-in-1 tubular latch with pop-out edge pull. The Pop Out Edge Pull is spring loaded and can be ejected from the door's edge with the press of a finger. This sliding door set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets. This Round Privacy Pocket Door Hardware be easily unlocked from the outside via an emergency turn on the exterior plate. Available in a wide array of finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Function:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy. It features a pop out edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket as well as a strike with dust box to receive the latch.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/dummy-round-pocket-door-set-emtek-2146\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/passage-round-tubular-pocket-door-set-emtek-2144\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Privacy Round Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2145.pdf?v=1704262401\"><b>Emtek 2145 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a pop-out edge pull, a privacy strike, dust box, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
