                "description": "The Privacy Round Tubular Pocket Door Set comes packaged with a 2-in-1 tubular latch with pop-out edge pull. The Pop Out Edge Pull is spring loaded and can be ejected from the door's edge with the press of a finger. This sliding door set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets. This Round Privacy Pocket Door Hardware be easily unlocked from the outside via an emergency turn on the exterior plate. Available in a wide array of finish colors.",
